Gate repaint: keep last {mode,title}; only setTitle/setImage on change; rebuild menu every state change.

But tray.ts imports electron — tests must not import it (Constitution IV: no Electron mocks). T014 tests test tray.test.ts label formatting — tray-label pure functions. Test file named tray.test.ts but tests pure helpers — I'll have it import from tray-label.ts. Fine.

